OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1795873694
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 12 Dec to Sat 26 Dec
OL,6,FHigh pressure may continue to be quite
OL,7,Fdominant across the UK at first, with
OL,8,Fweather systems weakening or slow
OL,9,Fmoving over or near the UK. Later in
OL,10,FDecember, there may be more influence
OL,11,Ffrom frontal systems moving in from
OL,12,Fthe west. Strong winds are possible at
OL,13,Ftimes, but windy weather overall is
OL,14,Fless likely than normal for winter.
OL,15,FTemperatures look likely to be close
OL,16,Fto normal overall, but perhaps lower
OL,17,Fthan normal at times in the north and
OL,18,Fnortheast where there is a chance of
OL,19,Fsome snow and ice at times. Milder
OL,20,Finterludes are perhaps more likely
OL,21,Ftowards the south and southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
